Keep the cabinet's network setup off the host

Games such as Harley Davidson run the Lindbergh network init as root: they set
the interface address, flush the routes and rewrite /etc/resolv.conf, which
leaves the host without DNS or its LAN address. Ignore the interface and route
ioctls and keep the resolver file inside the game directory.

--- a/src/loader/redirections/filesystemShared.c
+++ b/src/loader/redirections/filesystemShared.c
@@ -92,6 +92,9 @@
